| find_green_terracotta | position_near_with_facing | target=[6,1,6], max_dist=5 | Player must walk ~4 blocks toward structure AND face it |
| mine_gray_terracotta | inventory_has | item=gray_terracotta, min=1 | Mining with pickaxe drops block to inventory |
